OL,3,GNEWSAPoultry farmers' 'constant
OL,4,Aanxiety' over bird flu
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoultry farmers in Cornwall say they
OL,7,Fare on high alert following the latest
OL,8,Fbird flu housing order introduced this
OL,9,Fmonth.
OL,11,FBird flu - avian influenza - is an
OL,12,Finfectious disease affecting birds and
OL,13,Fcan be spread through saliva, faeces or
OL,14,Fcontaminated environments.
OL,16,FBird flu presents little risk to human
OL,17,Fhealth but can be catastrophic for
OL,18,Fpoultry flocks, and there have been
OL,19,Fseveral cases so far in the north and
OL,20,Feast of England this year.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
