OL,3,GNEWSAPoultry farmers' 'constant
OL,4,Aanxiety' over bird flu
OL,5,
OL,6,FJenny Olds, from Cornhill Farm, near
OL,7,FCamborne, said the disease was "an
OL,8,Fabsolute constant anxiety" that would
OL,9,Fbe "a massive cost for our business "
OL,10,Fif a case was confirmed.
